# 部署与运维

## 方式概览

- 本地：star-deploy 脚本构建/同步。
- 生产：`main` push 或 `workflow_dispatch` 触发 Actions，构建后 SCP 上传并重载 Nginx。

## 本地脚本（路径以本机 star-deploy 为准）

```bash
cd /Users/cdmac14013/docker/star-deploy/frontend
./deploy-frontend.sh deploy
./deploy-frontend.sh sync
./deploy-frontend.sh clean
```

```bash
cd /Users/cdmac14013/docker/star-deploy/backend
./deploy-backend.sh deploy local
./deploy-backend.sh restart local
./deploy-backend.sh logs star-reward
```

```bash
cd /Users/cdmac14013/docker/star-deploy
./deploy-all.sh local
```

## 健康检查

```bash
curl http://localhost/api/sso/health
curl http://localhost/api/reward/health
curl http://localhost/health
curl -I http://localhost/star/
```

## Vite 代理

```typescript
server: {
  proxy: {
    '/api': {
      target: 'http://localhost',
      changeOrigin: true,
    },
  },
}
```

## 构建

```bash
npm run build
```

产物：`dist/`。

## GitHub Actions

- Workflow：`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`
- 流程：`npm ci` → `npm run build` → SCP `dist` → 重载 Nginx。
- Secrets：`SERVER_HOST`、`SERVER_USER`、`SERVER_SSH_KEY`。

## 手动发布示例

```bash
npm run build
scp -r dist/* user@server:/opt/star-deploy/nginx/html/star/
ssh user@server "docker exec star-nginx nginx -s reload"
```

Portainer：`http://<服务器IP>/portainer/`。验证：`curl -I http://<服务器IP>/star/`。
